# Text is stored with LF in the repository regardless of the platform it was
# committed from.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated panels and shipped data are binary: never line-ending-converted,
# never diffed as text. EPS is PostScript and looks like text to git, but the
# densest panels carry a rasterised layer inside them.
*.eps  binary
*.png  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.gz   binary

# An executed notebook is JSON with base64 images in it. Keep it out of diffs;
# it is generated by tools/build_notebook.py.
*.ipynb -diff
